Package: llmshieldr
Title: Safety Guardrails for Large Language Model Workflows
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Description: A model-agnostic safety layer for large language model (LLM)
    applications in 'R'. Provides composable policies and inspectable checks
    for prompts, conversations, retrieved context, documents, tool calls and
    outputs, streams, URLs, and model responses. Supports deterministic rules,
    optional local or remote detectors, semantic review, provider-neutral chat
    workflows through 'ellmer', audits, and evaluation helpers. Maps controls
    to the OWASP LLM Top 10:2026
    <https://github.com/GenAI-Security-Project/GenAI-LLM-Top10/tree/main/2026/final>.
    This experimental package must be evaluated against each deployment's
    threats and traffic before production use.
